the templates are:
    the calculation date is *a date*; scenario element.
    the contiguous states count is *a number*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl 48 states dc table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl 48 states dc additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl alaska table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl alaska additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl hawaii table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl hawaii additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl 48 states dc table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl 48 states dc additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl alaska table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl alaska additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl hawaii table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl hawaii additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl 48 states dc table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl 48 states dc additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl alaska table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl alaska additional member is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl hawaii table for *a household size* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl hawaii additional member is *an amount*.
    the net income poverty level ratio is *a rate*.
    the gross income poverty level ratio is *a rate*.
    the elderly disabled separate household gross income poverty level ratio is *a rate*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl 48 states dc of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl alaska of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap net income limit 100 percent fpl hawaii of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl 48 states dc of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl alaska of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 130 percent fpl hawaii of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl 48 states dc of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl alaska of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the snap gross income limit 165 percent fpl hawaii of *a household* is *an amount*.
    the household size of *a household* is *a number*; scenario element.

