rule net_income_poverty_level_ratio with provenance "Net Monthly Income Eligibility Standards (100 Percent of Poverty Level)":
the net income poverty level ratio is 1 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D
    and D <= 2024-09-30.

rule gross_income_poverty_level_ratio with provenance "Gross Monthly Income Eligibility Standards (130 Percent of Poverty Level)":
the gross income poverty level ratio is 1.3 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D
    and D <= 2024-09-30.

rule elderly_disabled_separate_household_gross_income_poverty_level_ratio with provenance "Gross Monthly Income Eligibility Standards for Households Where Elderly Disabled Are a Separate Household (165 Percent of Poverty Level)":
